[gd_scene load_steps=7 format=3 uid="uid://unittextmeshautohint"]

; The one variable: a TextMesh with a TrueType font that has no hints of its own. Godot loads its
; glyphs through FreeType's auto-hinter, which snaps the stems, the x-height and the cap height to
; whole pixels. The scene is that of unit-text-mesh-hinting.tscn otherwise, at 12 px and 17 px.
; Every other TrueType golden font carries its own hints, or is a variable WOFF2 at 64 px.

